<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Workflows reported by experts in each domain</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We surveyed all contributing experts before about their day-to-day tasks. The activities reported in Table <a href="#A3.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix C Workflows reported by experts in each domain ‣ The AI Productivity Index (APEX)" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, Table <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix C Workflows reported by experts in each domain ‣ The AI Productivity Index (APEX)" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, Table <a href="#A3.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix C Workflows reported by experts in each domain ‣ The AI Productivity Index (APEX)" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, Table <a href="#A3.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix C Workflows reported by experts in each domain ‣ The AI Productivity Index (APEX)" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, and Table <a href="#A3.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix C Workflows reported by experts in each domain ‣ The AI Productivity Index (APEX)" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> are an estimate based on the experts’ responses.
We split law into litigation and corporate law given substantial differences in day-to-day work.</p>
</div>
