<p id="A4.tab1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><span id="A4.tab1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Law (ID 1045 cont.)</span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
