<span id="A4.tab1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">15</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.tab1.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Concludes that the five-year termination window for all the works at issue opened on January 1, 2024.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.tab1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.tab1.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
