<span id="A4.tab1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">16</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.tab1.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Concludes that the five-year termination window for all the works at issue will close on December 31, 2028.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.tab1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.tab1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">17</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.tab1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">States that to give effect to the termination of rights, the client must serve a written notice upon WMG.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.tab1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.tab1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">18</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.tab1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">States that the written notice to terminate must state the effective date of termination.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.tab1.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.tab1.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">19</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.tab1.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A4.tab1.2.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">States that the written notice to terminate must be served to WMG at least two years before, and at most ten years before, the stated effective date of termination.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.tab1.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.tab1.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
