<span id="A4.T11.4.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A4.T11.4.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Calculates the change in net working capital related to the diabetes segment to be <math id="A4.T11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\$14.11" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">$</mo><mn>14.11</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\$14.11</annotation></semantics></math> million in FY2024 (acceptable range is between <math id="A4.T11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\$13.97" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">$</mo><mn>13.97</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\$13.97</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.T11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\$14.25" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">$</mo><mn>14.25</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\$14.25</annotation></semantics></math> million).</span>
